**Profile**: Title: Dim Forest, Origin: Huanglong.

'''Dim Forest''' is a region in [[Huanglong]]. It is a forest consisting of many unique flora, such as the [[Violet Banyan]] and [[Giant Banyan]], with hostile life inhabiting the [[Forbidden Forest]]. A number of Jinzhou scientists spend their time here to study Hoochiefs.

